  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To establish and enhance a sustainable and comprehensive 24/7 primary healthcare service infrastructure in Camp 22, prioritizing the most vulnerable Rohingya individuals, including persons with disabilities, ensuring equitable access, quality care, and improved health outcomes.2.To establish case management system and provide general protection case management for vulnerable individuals and or those at heightened risk of violations</narrative>
